You can also create a while loop that

59
00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:10.677
counts down from ten.

60
00:02:10.717 --> 00:02:13.842
This is a great way to experiment with

61
00:02:13.922 --> 00:02:15.864
different conditions and collections.

62
00:02:16.565 --> 00:02:19.249
Remember, the more you practice, the more

63
00:02:19.349 --> 00:02:21.873
comfortable you’ll become with loops.

64
